/// A service instance that has announced itself on the broker.
///
/// Discovery reports the interface's announcement and nothing more.  Property values are
/// deliberately not collected here: doing so would mean subscribing to every property of
/// every instance whether or not the application ever reads one.  The client subscribes
/// to the individual properties it is asked for instead.
